    "description": "Using sophisticated climbing and rigging techniques, cut away dead or excess branches from trees or shrubs to maintain right-of-way for roads, sidewalks, or utilities, or to improve appearance, health, and value of tree. Prune or treat trees or shrubs using handsaws, hand pruners, clippers, and power pruners. Works off the ground in the tree canopy and may use truck-mounted lifts.",
    "chunk_text": "Tree Trimmers and Pruners (also known in India as Sr. Tree Trimmers and Pruners, Tree Trimmers and Pruners Executive) is a professional in the Healthcare & Medical domain. Using sophisticated climbing and rigging techniques, cut away dead or excess branches from trees or shrubs to maintain right-of-way for roads, sidewalks, or utilities, or to improve appearance, health... Day-to-day activities include analyzing requirements and planning deliverables, collaborating with cross-functional teams, preparing documentation and reports, applying domain expertise to solve complex challenges, and mentoring junior professionals. Core skills required include Cleaning Techniques, Equipment Operation, Chemical Safety, Time Management, Physical Stamina, Attention to Detail, Safety Protocols, Team Coordination, along with strong communication and adaptability. Foundational knowledge areas span Cleaning Products, Safety Standards, Waste Management, Facilities Operations, Health Regulations. This career suits realistic and hands-on personalities who are reliable, physically active, thorough. Facility services in India organized through contract companies like Quess Corp, Sodexo, ISS. ITI certification preferred. Integrated facility management growing in IT parks, hospitals, and corporate campuses. In India, freshers can expect starting salaries of \u20b91\u20133 LPA, with mid-career professionals earning \u20b94\u20136 LPA and senior roles reaching \u20b96\u201310+ LPA; stability is typically achieved within 3\u20135 years with consistent performance. Key employment hubs in India include All major cities; some relocation is often necessary to access premium opportunities. Internationally, this career has strong demand in the US, UK, Canada, and Australia, with skilled worker visas (H-1B, Tier-2) and competitive salaries available for qualified professionals.",
